WEBVTT

00:01.126 --> 00:02.210
Armin.

00:02.544 --> 00:05.714
It's nice that I could be
a "good person" for you.

00:07.132 --> 00:09.134
For now, you've won your bet.

00:10.593 --> 00:11.511
But

00:12.429 --> 00:13.888
my bet

00:14.139 --> 00:15.515
begins now!

00:32.490 --> 00:35.493
We believe we've found out
who the Female Titan is.

00:37.037 --> 00:38.496
Her name is...

00:39.122 --> 00:40.206
Annie!

02:26.354 --> 02:28.731
A FEW DAYS AGO

02:29.899 --> 02:31.151
What's taking so long?

02:31.651 --> 02:34.863
Where the hell are Erwin's men?

02:35.697 --> 02:39.450
At this rate, the Military Police Regiment
escort is going to show up before them.

02:41.286 --> 02:45.874
Must be having a hell of
a hard time taking a shit.

02:49.294 --> 02:52.213
You're very talkative today, Captain.

02:52.297 --> 02:53.548
Don't be stupid.

02:54.090 --> 02:55.925
I talk a lot.

03:05.643 --> 03:06.853
I'm sorry.

03:07.228 --> 03:10.648
If only I hadn't made
the wrong choice then,

03:11.149 --> 03:12.317
none of this would have happened.

03:14.068 --> 03:17.864
I told you. No one knows
how things will turn out.

03:21.117 --> 03:23.494
- Sorry, I'm late.
- Not at all.

03:25.288 --> 03:26.247
Guys!

03:28.875 --> 03:29.876
Well...

03:29.959 --> 03:32.754
We believe we've found out
who the Female Titan is.

03:32.837 --> 03:33.838
What?

03:34.213 --> 03:36.132
We will capture her this time.

03:41.095 --> 03:42.931
We will do it the day after tomorrow,

03:43.389 --> 03:48.144
while passing through Stohess District
on our way to the capital.

03:48.895 --> 03:51.356
This will be our first
and last chance to capture her.

03:51.814 --> 03:55.193
Once on the other side,
the government will take custody of Eren,

03:55.735 --> 03:59.405
and we'll have difficulty investigating
those bent on destroying the Walls.

04:00.406 --> 04:03.952
Both of which will foster
mankind's destruction.

04:04.827 --> 04:07.080
We'll have to bet everything
on this operation.

04:09.290 --> 04:10.458
This is the plan.

04:11.501 --> 04:14.754
While passing through Stohess,
we use Eren as bait

04:14.837 --> 04:17.131
to lure the target
into this underground passage

04:17.632 --> 04:19.300
Given the target's size and strength,

04:19.592 --> 04:21.386
if we can get her as far down as possible

04:21.803 --> 04:25.390
we should be able to
immobilize her in her Titan form.

04:26.182 --> 04:28.768
But in the event that
she transforms before then,

04:29.227 --> 04:31.646
it will be up to you, Eren.

04:32.438 --> 04:33.439
Yes, sir!

04:33.690 --> 04:37.860
Are we certain the target
will actually be in Stohess then?

04:38.194 --> 04:41.281
Yes. The target is a member
of the Military Police Regiment.

04:41.531 --> 04:42.740
The Military Police Regiment?

04:43.032 --> 04:44.993
It was Armin who identified her.

04:46.077 --> 04:50.873
We believe that she killed
the two Titans we caught alive

04:51.666 --> 04:55.336
and that she might have trained with you
in the 104th Cadet Corps.

04:56.754 --> 04:59.257
Hold on a minute.

04:59.507 --> 05:00.967
The 104th Cadet Corps...

05:01.301 --> 05:04.470
The name of the girl we believe
to be the Female Titan is...

05:04.554 --> 05:06.597
You can't be serious.

05:12.937 --> 05:15.606
Annie Leonhart.

05:26.534 --> 05:28.494
Oh, no.

05:35.084 --> 05:37.086
Damn! That ring...

05:37.378 --> 05:40.298
She knew I was lying from the very start!

05:40.798 --> 05:43.009
She saw the ambush
coming from a mile away!

05:43.593 --> 05:46.471
Surely, there must have been a better way!

05:47.055 --> 05:48.931
Save the regrets for later!

05:49.390 --> 05:51.225
What should we do now?

05:53.102 --> 05:56.355
First, we rendezvous with
the 3rd Squad and get above ground.

05:56.689 --> 06:01.319
Then we fight Annie,
the Female Titan, as per plan B!

06:01.986 --> 06:05.573
Eren, you'll help catch her
in your Titan form, just as we planned.

06:06.324 --> 06:07.241
All right?

06:07.658 --> 06:08.493
Yes!

06:09.243 --> 06:10.328
Hey!

06:11.287 --> 06:12.330
It's the 3rd Squad!

06:12.830 --> 06:14.791
Plan A failed?

06:15.124 --> 06:16.292
It did!

06:16.876 --> 06:18.878
Please switch to the backup plan!

06:29.847 --> 06:31.140
She stomped through it?

06:34.185 --> 06:35.686
- We have to help them!
- Eren!

06:35.770 --> 06:36.729
Get back!

06:36.813 --> 06:39.107
Hey! Mikasa!

06:40.566 --> 06:44.028
Does she not care if she kills Eren?

06:44.654 --> 06:45.696
She took a gamble.

06:47.365 --> 06:50.284
She gambled on Eren surviving
when she made that hole.

06:50.785 --> 06:53.121
This makes her all the more formidable!

06:55.414 --> 06:58.668
Annie is that desperate to catch Eren now!

07:03.798 --> 07:06.509
Now what?
Our escape route has been cut off.

07:06.968 --> 07:08.803
And she'll be ready, waiting for us

07:08.886 --> 07:11.097
if we make a run for it
using our omnidirectional mobility gear.

07:11.264 --> 07:12.306
That said...

07:16.686 --> 07:20.273
If we stay here, there's no telling
when she'll stomp on us.

07:21.649 --> 07:22.984
I'll manage somehow!

07:23.317 --> 07:25.778
Just like when I stopped that cannonball!

07:28.573 --> 07:30.283
- Come here!
- Hey...

07:30.616 --> 07:32.702
Here goes! Stay close!

07:42.003 --> 07:42.837
What?

07:44.338 --> 07:45.465
Again?

07:46.048 --> 07:47.383
Damn it!

07:51.095 --> 07:52.638
Of all times...

07:52.722 --> 07:54.974
Damn, that hurt!

07:57.518 --> 08:01.022
You can't transform
without a clear goal, right?

08:01.689 --> 08:03.733
Try to focus again! Hard!

08:03.941 --> 08:05.026
I'm trying to!

08:05.109 --> 08:06.194
But it's not...

08:13.826 --> 08:14.869
Are you sure?

08:16.496 --> 08:20.041
Could it be you still have qualms
about fighting Annie?

08:23.169 --> 08:24.212
Eren?

08:25.087 --> 08:29.091
After all this,
don't tell me you still think

08:29.175 --> 08:31.636
that Annie can't possibly
be the Female Titan.

08:33.554 --> 08:36.557
Didn't you see that just now?

08:37.141 --> 08:39.477
She killed our comrades, you know.

08:39.977 --> 08:41.521
Do you still think it's not her?

08:44.273 --> 08:45.566
Give me a break!

08:45.816 --> 08:47.360
I'm trying here!

08:50.947 --> 08:52.698
Annie is the Female Titan?

08:53.699 --> 08:54.617
What makes...

08:55.159 --> 08:57.411
what makes you think that, Armin?

08:58.538 --> 09:02.041
The Female Titan knew
what you looked like from the start.

09:02.708 --> 09:06.212
Plus, she reacted to
your nickname of "suicidal maniac,"

09:06.462 --> 09:08.798
something only our classmates would know

09:09.549 --> 09:10.883
But the primary reason 

09:11.050 --> 09:15.346
is that I believe she killed
the test subjects, Sawney and Beane.

09:17.348 --> 09:19.350
How do you know that?

09:19.600 --> 09:23.145
Killing them would have required
real skill,

09:23.521 --> 09:26.941
so she would have used
the omnidirectional mobility gear.

09:27.149 --> 09:30.528
Yes, but they held
that equipment inspection.

09:30.820 --> 09:32.363
Annie's was fine.

09:32.572 --> 09:35.908
Because she presented Marco's gear.

09:36.867 --> 09:39.370
That's how she avoided being caught.

09:40.413 --> 09:41.289
What?

09:41.831 --> 09:43.541
What are you saying?

09:44.166 --> 09:46.168
What has Marco got to do with this?

09:47.253 --> 09:48.379
I'm not sure.

09:49.338 --> 09:50.840
Maybe you just saw wrong?

09:50.923 --> 09:53.134
No, I definitely recognized--

09:53.217 --> 09:54.468
Hey, kid.

09:54.719 --> 09:56.429
We get it.

09:56.637 --> 09:58.264
Do you have any concrete evidence?

09:58.472 --> 09:59.640
No, sir.

10:00.182 --> 10:03.352
Personally, I think Annie
and the Female Titan look alike.

10:03.686 --> 10:05.730
What? Are you crazy?

10:06.105 --> 10:07.398
What kind of evidence is--

10:07.481 --> 10:10.067
So basically,
we're going after her without proof.

10:10.610 --> 10:12.069
Without proof?

10:12.528 --> 10:13.571
You can't be serious.

10:13.904 --> 10:14.989
Why?

10:15.281 --> 10:17.199
What if it isn't Annie?

10:17.366 --> 10:20.786
If it isn't Annie,
then she'll be cleared of suspicion.

10:21.662 --> 10:24.290
I'll feel bad for causing her trouble
if that happens.

10:24.540 --> 10:25.541
But

10:25.916 --> 10:30.755
if we do nothing, the government
will make a sacrificial victim out of you.

10:31.505 --> 10:34.216
You guys are crazy for doubting Annie.

10:34.383 --> 10:35.301
Eren.

10:35.426 --> 10:38.763
Does this talk about Annie ring any bells?

10:47.772 --> 10:50.691
You fought hand-to-hand with
the Female Titan.

10:51.025 --> 10:54.153
Did you see her use
any techniques only Annie uses?

11:12.421 --> 11:13.839
You've realized, haven't you?

11:16.550 --> 11:20.012
You've realized that
the Female Titan is Annie.

11:24.141 --> 11:27.186
Then you know you have to fight.

11:28.479 --> 11:32.983
Or are there certain,
special feelings stopping you?

11:33.275 --> 11:34.402
What?

11:39.740 --> 11:41.158
I have a plan!

11:42.451 --> 11:46.288
Mikasa and I will exit that hole
and that entrance at the same time.

11:46.622 --> 11:49.208
At that point,
Annie will go for one of us.

11:49.708 --> 11:52.628
When she does, run the opposite way, Eren!

11:52.962 --> 11:54.004
Wait!

11:54.505 --> 11:56.966
That means one of you will get killed!

11:57.258 --> 11:59.552
If we stay here, all three of us will die!

12:00.302 --> 12:01.887
Mikasa! Get in position!

12:02.096 --> 12:03.722
Right! I'll take this way!

12:06.016 --> 12:07.017
Mikasa!

12:07.476 --> 12:08.519
Armin!

12:09.520 --> 12:10.521
How...

12:11.355 --> 12:13.649
how are you guys able to fight?

12:14.108 --> 12:15.317
How?

12:19.947 --> 12:21.198
We don't have a choice.

12:22.616 --> 12:24.618
We live in a cruel world.

12:45.639 --> 12:46.515
Eren!

13:02.740 --> 13:05.826
Annie! I won't let you have Eren!

13:07.703 --> 13:08.537
Eren!

13:10.164 --> 13:11.040
Eren!

13:11.415 --> 13:12.541
I'm coming!

13:16.295 --> 13:17.963
Open your eyes!

13:43.113 --> 13:44.865
Don't let the Female Titan escape!

13:45.324 --> 13:48.160
We can't let her get away!

13:53.874 --> 13:55.167
What's going on?

13:55.751 --> 13:57.461
Escort Squad! I'll hold this position!

13:57.545 --> 13:58.754
See what's happening!

13:58.921 --> 13:59.797
Understood!

14:02.007 --> 14:03.259
Something is up.

14:03.634 --> 14:06.220
First, there was that big explosion,
and now...

14:06.303 --> 14:07.137
Nile!

14:07.930 --> 14:09.515
Deploy all troops immediately.

14:10.140 --> 14:12.351
We should assume a Titan has appeared.

14:12.434 --> 14:14.270
Are you crazy?

14:14.395 --> 14:16.188
This is Wall Sina, you know!

14:16.272 --> 14:18.816
No Titan would show up here!

14:20.067 --> 14:21.735
Halt! Stop right there, Jaeger!

14:21.819 --> 14:24.572
I'm done playing dress-up!

14:25.906 --> 14:28.617
Never call me that name again,
you halfwit!

14:29.660 --> 14:31.620
Commander! I want to help too!

14:31.829 --> 14:33.747
Ask the 4th Squad for equipment.

14:33.914 --> 14:34.790
Understood!

14:35.165 --> 14:38.836
Bravado is nice and all,
but just remember to stay alive.

14:39.128 --> 14:39.962
Yes, sir!

14:41.922 --> 14:42.798
What?

14:42.965 --> 14:44.925
Erwin! What the hell was that?

14:45.009 --> 14:46.552
Commander! I brought it!

14:48.804 --> 14:50.264
- Good work.
- Thank you, sir!

14:52.558 --> 14:53.767
Hold on, Erwin!

14:55.019 --> 14:57.104
All able-bodied soldiers, follow me!

14:57.354 --> 14:59.189
We're going to rendezvous
with the Capture Squad!

15:00.983 --> 15:01.817
Erwin!

15:01.901 --> 15:02.860
Stop!

15:05.446 --> 15:09.825
You're committing a clear act of treason
against the Royal Government!

15:10.451 --> 15:14.997
Nile, are you as rubbish-brained
as you look?

15:15.831 --> 15:18.334
You don't seem to understand
what's happening here.

15:19.084 --> 15:21.253
Remove your gear, Erwin!

15:23.631 --> 15:25.299
There's a Titan!

15:25.382 --> 15:27.801
- What is it doing here?
- What about the Wall?

15:28.844 --> 15:31.138
Hey. That's a Titan, right?

15:31.430 --> 15:32.848
Yes? Why?

15:32.932 --> 15:33.849
Out of the way!

15:36.644 --> 15:39.021
Just look at them, not giving a crap!

15:39.730 --> 15:43.067
And to think
that could have been me up there too.

15:43.275 --> 15:45.611
Man, what got into me?

15:45.986 --> 15:46.904
Damn!

15:49.031 --> 15:52.242
Don't try to kill her!
We just need to stop her!

16:04.046 --> 16:07.216
It's no use! She's familiar with
the omnidirectional mobility maneuvers!

16:11.470 --> 16:14.306
I won't make this easy for you!

16:22.106 --> 16:23.774
Eren! Say something!

16:23.941 --> 16:25.025
Eren!

16:25.275 --> 16:26.902
Hey! What the hell are you doing?

16:26.986 --> 16:29.113
Jean! Eren is stuck under here!

16:29.196 --> 16:32.282
What? Wasn't he supposed to
turn into a Titan?

16:32.700 --> 16:34.034
He couldn't!

16:34.118 --> 16:37.871
I think the fact that the Female Titan
is Annie is holding him back.

16:38.122 --> 16:39.039
What?

16:39.790 --> 16:41.458
For now, we have to help him!

16:41.917 --> 16:43.794
Jean! Give me a hand!

16:44.837 --> 16:46.255
He couldn't do it?

16:48.465 --> 16:50.801
Damn it, Eren! Quit screwing around!

16:51.176 --> 16:53.846
I told you we would need
to count on you someday!

16:54.304 --> 16:59.226
We're forced to put the world, humans,
and our own lives in your hands,

16:59.309 --> 17:01.854
and this is all you have to show for it?

17:02.396 --> 17:04.690
Marco didn't... Marco can't have...

17:05.190 --> 17:06.358
Damn it!

17:16.410 --> 17:17.327
Eren.

17:17.911 --> 17:21.290
It's no use! We have to do
something about her first!

17:25.044 --> 17:25.961
Eren.

17:26.837 --> 17:29.214
There's something I told Jean once.

17:30.424 --> 17:32.760
Those who can't abandon anything

17:33.552 --> 17:35.429
can't change anything.

17:36.513 --> 17:40.893
The ability to give up your humanity
when forced to rise above monsters,

17:41.727 --> 17:44.146
I think that's something Annie can do.

17:45.314 --> 17:47.524
Although, I don't know why she does it.

17:47.983 --> 17:48.817
But

17:49.401 --> 17:51.320
whoever can do that will prevail!

18:05.209 --> 18:06.043
Annie!

18:07.294 --> 18:09.254
If you don't kill me this time,

18:09.671 --> 18:13.008
your sore excuses about "your real
bet starting now" will be worthless!

18:18.764 --> 18:19.890
Armin! This way!

18:20.182 --> 18:21.225
Understood!

18:31.693 --> 18:34.238
- She's coming...
- Section Commander.

18:34.863 --> 18:37.574
You have that crazy look in your eyes.

19:08.564 --> 19:09.481
All right!

19:09.940 --> 19:14.027
Personally, I thought having
a plan C seemed like overkill.

19:14.403 --> 19:16.947
But Commander Erwin
really does know his stuff.

19:19.783 --> 19:21.118
Now, then...

19:25.497 --> 19:28.458
I suggest you be
a good girl and behave yourself.

19:32.504 --> 19:37.801
You can't call any Titans
to eat you this time.

19:40.596 --> 19:41.763
But don't worry.

19:43.140 --> 19:45.601
I'll savor the information

19:46.393 --> 19:49.605
that I'll pry from you instead.

19:55.569 --> 19:56.695
She broke free?

19:57.696 --> 19:59.781
Looks like we didn't set enough traps!

20:00.532 --> 20:01.825
Don't let her escape! After her!

20:08.832 --> 20:11.335
Those who can't abandon anything

20:12.878 --> 20:15.088
can't change anything!

20:16.924 --> 20:17.925
I know.

20:18.425 --> 20:19.676
I failed before

20:21.053 --> 20:25.015
when I clung to my friends
and the bond we shared.

20:26.892 --> 20:28.060
Think back.

20:41.073 --> 20:43.909
I'm going to drive them out.

20:44.576 --> 20:45.410
No.

20:46.078 --> 20:47.162
Kill them!

20:51.875 --> 20:54.878
There's no time to think
whether it's right or wrong.

20:55.879 --> 20:57.297
Just act.

20:57.881 --> 21:00.175
Don't try to end things all nice and neat!

21:01.009 --> 21:02.094
Yes.

21:02.636 --> 21:03.553
Mikasa!

21:04.388 --> 21:06.723
We live in a cruel world!

21:16.400 --> 21:17.859
Now what?

21:54.062 --> 21:54.980
Eren!

21:56.606 --> 21:57.607
Eren.

23:40.043 --> 23:43.964
"I'm going to drive out
every last Titan from this world."

23:44.965 --> 23:50.011
The anger that drove young Eren
to make that vow that day

23:50.720 --> 23:53.390
now drives him to destroy everything.
